WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Mom, let me ask you something

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,040
Just say something if you have something to say

3
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,240
Don't get into trouble here

4
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:06,120
Have you seen Song Yi and Uncle Qin today?

5
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:08,080
Don't tell them how they are feeling.

6
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:10,000
I went for a walk in the morning and met you Song Yi.

7
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,360
She is in a very good mood today

8
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:14,000
Your Uncle Qin used to spend his holidays at the company.

9
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,560
I didn’t even go to the company today

10
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:17,240
Standing in the yard laughing early in the morning

11
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,220
Feeling so good

12
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,900
It seems that after knowing about Yu Yu,

13
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:21,860
Very happy

14
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:24,750
Why are you giggling here?

15
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:28,340
No, nothing

16
00:00:29,230 --> 00:00:30,350
I'll go next door and go through the door

17
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:31,710
You don’t have to cook for me at noon

18
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,720
What do you think the surprise will be for our daughter?

19
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,960
How many times have you asked this all morning?
